---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="D-day 디데이 & 기념일 · 수습기간 계산기"
  description="목표일까지 남은 D-day, 지난 날짜수, 커플 100일·200일·1주년 기념일, 직장인 수습 3개월 만료일, 시험 및 프로젝트 D-day를 실시간 정확히 계산해요."
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-3 inline-block">← 전체 도구 목록</a>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
        실시간 날짜 연산 및 주요 기념일 자동 계산
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground">
        D-day 디데이 & 기념일 · 수습 만료일 계산기
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        기준일과 목표일을 입력하면 남은 D-day와 경과일은 물론, 수습 3개월 만료일 및 100일·200일·1년 기념일을 한눈에 확인해요.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Card -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-xs mb-8 space-y-6">
      <!-- Mode selection tabs -->
      <div class="flex gap-2 border-b border-border pb-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="tabTarget"
          class="mode-tab rounded-lg bg-primary/10 border border-primary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-primary transition-colors"
        >
          목표일 D-day 계산
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="tabAnniversary"
          class="mode-tab rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50"
        >
          기념일 · 수습 3개월 계산
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1: Target Date D-day -->
      <div id="sectionTarget" class="space-y-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <label for="baseDate" class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block mb-1.5">
              기준일 (오늘 또는 시작일)
            </label>
            <input
              type="date"
              id="baseDate"
              class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="targetDate" class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block mb-1.5">
              목표일 (시험·전역·이벤트)
            </label>
            <input
              type="date"
              id="targetDate"
              class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
          <input type="checkbox" id="includeBaseDay" class="rounded border-input text-primary focus:ring-primary" />
          <label for="includeBaseDay" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground cursor-pointer">
            기준일을 1일째로 포함 (기념일·만기 계산 방식)
          </label>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Banner -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-6 text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground block mb-1">D-DAY RESULT</span>
          <div id="ddayBadge" class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary font-mono my-2">
            D-0
          </div>
          <p id="ddayDesc" class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">
            오늘이 목표일이에요.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Anniversary / Probation Calc -->
      <div id="sectionAnniversary" class="space-y-4 hidden">
        <div>
          <label for="startDate" class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block mb-1.5">
            시작일 (입사일 · 교제 시작일)
          </label>
          <input
            type="date"
            id="startDate"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">자동 계산된 주요 기념일 & 만료일</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3" id="milestonesGrid">
            <!-- Dynamically injected -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Informational Guide -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 space-y-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">💡 D-day 및 수습기간 계산 팁</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1.5">
        <li><strong>D-day 기본 표기</strong>: 목표일까지 날짜가 남아있으면 <code class="text-foreground">D-N</code>, 목표일 당일은 <code class="text-foreground">D-Day (D-0)</code>, 지난 날짜는 <code class="text-foreground">D+N</code>으로 표기돼요.</li>
        <li><strong>직장인 수습 3개월 만료일</strong>: 근로기준법상 월 단위 기간 계산(민법 제160조)에 따라, 입사일로부터 3개월이 경과한 날의 전날 자정에 수습기간이 만료돼요. (예: 3월 2일 입사 시 6월 1일 만료, 6월 2일부터 본채용)</li>
        <li><strong>커플 100일 기념일</strong>: 사귀기 시작한 첫날을 1일째로 포함하여 계산하는 것이 일반적이에요. (체크박스를 활성화하세요)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    const todayStr = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];
    const baseDateInput = document.getElementById('baseDate');
    const targetDateInput = document.getElementById('targetDate');
    const startDateInput = document.getElementById('startDate');
    const includeBaseDay = document.getElementById('includeBaseDay');

    const tabTarget = document.getElementById('tabTarget');
    const tabAnniversary = document.getElementById('tabAnniversary');
    const sectionTarget = document.getElementById('sectionTarget');
    const sectionAnniversary = document.getElementById('sectionAnniversary');

    const ddayBadge = document.getElementById('ddayBadge');
    const ddayDesc = document.getElementById('ddayDesc');
    const milestonesGrid = document.getElementById('milestonesGrid');

    baseDateInput.value = todayStr;
    startDateInput.value = todayStr;

    // Default target date: +30 days
    const defaultTarget = new Date();
    defaultTarget.setDate(defaultTarget.getDate() + 30);
    targetDateInput.value = defaultTarget.toISOString().split('T')[0];

    function calculateDday() {
      const base = new Date(baseDateInput.value + 'T00:00:00');
      const target = new Date(targetDateInput.value + 'T00:00:00');

      if (isNaN(base.getTime()) || isNaN(target.getTime())) return;

      const diffTime = target.getTime() - base.getTime();
      let diffDays = Math.round(diffTime / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));

      if (includeBaseDay.checked) {
        if (diffDays > 0) diffDays += 1;
      }

      if (diffDays === 0) {
        ddayBadge.textContent = 'D-Day';
        ddayBadge.className = 'text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-500 font-mono my-2';
        ddayDesc.textContent = '오늘이 목표 당일이에요! 🎉';
      } else if (diffDays > 0) {
        ddayBadge.textContent = `D-${diffDays}`;
        ddayBadge.className = 'text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary font-mono my-2';
        ddayDesc.textContent = `목표일까지 ${diffDays}일 남았어요.`;
      } else {
        const past = Math.abs(diffDays);
        ddayBadge.textContent = `D+${past}`;
        ddayBadge.className = 'text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-muted-foreground font-mono my-2';
        ddayDesc.textContent = `목표일로부터 ${past}일 지났어요.`;
      }
    }

    function calculateMilestones() {
      const start = new Date(startDateInput.value + 'T00:00:00');
      if (isNaN(start.getTime())) return;

      function addDays(d, days) {
        const res = new Date(d);
        res.setDate(res.getDate() + days - 1);
        return res.toISOString().split('T')[0];
      }

      function addMonths(d, months) {
        const res = new Date(d);
        res.setMonth(res.getMonth() + months);
        res.setDate(res.getDate() - 1); // Korean legal probation end
        return res.toISOString().split('T')[0];
      }

      const items = [
        { label: '수습 3개월 만료일', date: addMonths(start, 3), badge: '직장/노무' },
        { label: '교제 100일', date: addDays(start, 100), badge: '기념일' },
        { label: '교제 200일', date: addDays(start, 200), badge: '기념일' },
        { label: '교제 300일', date: addDays(start, 300), badge: '기념일' },
        { label: '1주년 (365일)', date: addDays(start, 365), badge: '기념일' },
        { label: '1,000일', date: addDays(start, 1000), badge: '기념일' },
      ];

      milestonesGrid.innerHTML = items
        .map(
          (item) => `
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg border border-border bg-background">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">${item.label}</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted text-muted-foreground font-semibold">${item.badge}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-0.5">${item.date}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-primary">
            ${getDaysText(item.date)}
          </div>
        </div>
      `
        )
        .join('');
    }

    function getDaysText(targetStr) {
      const today = new Date(todayStr + 'T00:00:00');
      const target = new Date(targetStr + 'T00:00:00');
      const diff = Math.round((target.getTime() - today.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));
      if (diff === 0) return '오늘 (D-Day)';
      if (diff > 0) return `D-${diff}`;
      return `D+${Math.abs(diff)}`;
    }

    baseDateInput.addEventListener('input', calculateDday);
    targetDateInput.addEventListener('input', calculateDday);
    includeBaseDay.addEventListener('change', calculateDday);
    startDateInput.addEventListener('input', calculateMilestones);

    tabTarget.addEventListener('click', () => {
      tabTarget.className = 'mode-tab rounded-lg bg-primary/10 border border-primary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-primary transition-colors';
      tabAnniversary.className = 'mode-tab rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50';
      sectionTarget.classList.remove('hidden');
      sectionAnniversary.classList.add('hidden');
    });

    tabAnniversary.addEventListener('click', () => {
      tabAnniversary.className = 'mode-tab rounded-lg bg-primary/10 border border-primary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-primary transition-colors';
      tabTarget.className = 'mode-tab rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50';
      sectionAnniversary.classList.remove('hidden');
      sectionTarget.classList.add('hidden');
      calculateMilestones();
    });

    calculateDday();
    calculateMilestones();
  </script>
</Layout>
